This directory contains the retired GStreamer 0.10 plugin sources. GStreamer
0.10 is obsolete and this plugin is not built or installed by the top-level
Makefile.

Use the maintained GStreamer 1.x plugin in `../gst-plugin-1.0` instead. Its
build and playback instructions are in `../gst-plugin-1.0/README.md` and the
repository-level `README.md`.
